{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1290139-the-library-acquistion-squad","id":1290139,"title":"The Library Acquistion Squad!!!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-20T16:49:25-08:00","id":1290139,"title":"The Library Acquistion Squad!!!","content":"This is an Aeon period game for Novas. All PCs will be second generation Novas with <b>NO TAINT</b>! Although these Novas will be built with Fifty Nova points they will need to be optimized for stealth, skill, and Taint Resistance. Otherwise, use the standard rules for Nova creation in the Aberrant book.<br /> <br /> The PCs are from a World called New Avalon. This lovely largely Earthlike world is thriving. It was founded by a group of US and Canadian Novas who brought substantial groups of people from post-apocalyptic Earth. The planet now has a population of 120 million people living at a technological level equivalent to but not identical to Earth. Compared to Earth New Avalon is<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"> more prosperous when it comes to raw material, housing, and basic material goods, though they have fewer luxuries and other problems. New Avalon is a representative democracy, the head of government is the Premier who leads a proportionally elected unicameral legislature, the head of state is a largely honorary post, is the President. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Although the people of New Avalon are prosperous, they feel the lack of certain things. Relatively few books, films, CDs or works of art were brought along with the original colonists, they were refugees fleeing disaster after all. It's not like Earth would sell them these things. Similarly, there are many herbs and spices that weren't brought along in the crisis.<br /> <br /> The PCs are members of the <b>Library Acquisition Squad!!</b> braving the dangers of Earth to bring Cultural material and botanical specimens to your Homeworld!</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 02-20-2019, 07:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-20T23:59:11-08:00","id":1290261,"title":"","content":"My god... you\u2019re a madman...a Maaaadmaaaan!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-21T03:01:24-08:00","id":1290281,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1290139-the-library-acquistion-squad?p=1290261#post1290261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My god... you\u2019re a madman...a Maaaadmaaaan!</div> </div> </div> </div>Must use the same words.... looks like a lot of fun... from the view of the New Avalonians, it would be like a group of scavangers looking for specific resources on a post apokaliptical world, as they are far superior and never had the issues Earth had...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-21T12:19:50-08:00","id":1290480,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1290139-the-library-acquistion-squad?p=1290281#post1290281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Must use the same words.... looks like a lot of fun... from the view of the New Avalonians, it would be like a group of scavengers looking for specific resources on a post-apocalyptical world, as they are far superior and never had the issues Earth had...</div> </div> </div> </div>They aren't snobs, although they do see Aeon's Earth as a sad and scary place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-21T12:20:56-08:00","id":1290482,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1290139-the-library-acquistion-squad?p=1290261#post1290261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My god... you\u2019re a madman...a Maaaadmaaaan!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Praise accepted with gratitude.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-21T12:32:51-08:00","id":1290489,"title":"","content":"By the way, during the chaos caused by Divis Mal and the Chinese threat to destroy the world, the Novas leading the Exodus to New Avalon cleared out the library of a small midwestern Liberal Arts University. The school had been closed because of financial issues unrelated to the crisis. Although it was a good library, it was mainly in the English language, like most American universities. So the team is looking not just for English language books but for library materials in several languages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-21T13:01:33-08:00","id":1290502,"title":"","content":"How many languages are prominent in New Avalon? Their whole world is Terraformed right, they just need to populate it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-21T14:29:13-08:00","id":1290536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1290139-the-library-acquistion-squad?p=1290502#post1290502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How many languages are prominent in New Avalon? Their whole world is Terraformed right, they just need to populate it?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well everybody speaks English. Because of the groups they're drawn from, English, French ( Canadian), Gaelic (also Canadian), Spanish, and Cherokee, are spoken. But they want to be able to able study all of Earth's cultures. <br /> <br /> New Avalon is a terraformed world with only Earth lifeforms. They do have a pronatalist policy, but they aren't bullies about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-30T13:07:49-08:00","id":1547340,"title":"","content":"The people of New Avalon might want to recruit refugees and the desperately poor. Figuring who to approach and how would be lively role playing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}